  | @ref Rodin::Variational "Variational" | <a href="_variational_8h.html"><code>&lt;Rodin/Variational.h&gt;</code></a> | Finite element fields and weak forms | @ref Rodin::Variational::H1 "H1", @ref Rodin::Variational::GridFunction "GridFunction", @ref Rodin::Variational::Problem "Problem" |
  | @ref Rodin::Assembly "Assembly" | <a href="_assembly_8h.html"><code>&lt;Rodin/Assembly.h&gt;</code></a> | Local integration and global assembly | @ref Rodin::Assembly::Sequential "Sequential", @ref Rodin::Assembly::Default "Default" |
  | @ref Rodin::Solver "Solver" | <a href="_solver_8h.html"><code>&lt;Rodin/Solver.h&gt;</code></a> | Linear and nonlinear systems | @ref Rodin::Solver::CG "CG", @ref Rodin::Solver::SparseLU "SparseLU", @ref Rodin::Solver::NewtonSolver "NewtonSolver" |
